\begin_layout Itemize
Only the printable form of an object is recorded,
 so direct memory references are lost.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Built-ins are backquoted (e.g.,
 + becomes `+) to preserve some of the effects of STATIC.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Strings containing quotes are not currently stored correctly.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Margin and indentation settings are pulled from ANSI.default.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
If the file exists,
 it is appended to rather than overwritten.
\end_layout

